ng else but yell."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whether I've changed or not... you certainly have."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Looks like you haven't been having a good time at Blackgold Universal."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander rambles on, trying to distract Hecate. While speaking, they flick a slim blade from their boot and try to wedge it into the rock face to gain some footing."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"background","value":"2024AB_Hecateb","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Zipper","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But the clump of wild grass they've been using as a handhold gives way, and they fall again."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Slap","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"2024AB_Hecate","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.7","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_carmona","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hecate catches the rope."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Veins bulge in her forearms. Supporting the Commander and Kuro's combined weight is clearly pushing her strength."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hecate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shut up."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you two alright?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With Hecate's help, Mityl grabs hold of the rope again. She's still visibly shaken from the near-disaster."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spritePosition","value":"0,-50","raw":"Position"}],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get up here already!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Blackgold Operative","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Captain?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hecate ignores her subordinate. She extends a hand to the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hecate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop wasting time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Haha... hahahaha..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The Commander lets out a breathless laugh instead of grabbing it immediately."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I take back what I said—you haven't changed a bit either."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, do you two mind? I'm still dangling down here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kuro's voice floats up from below, the safety rope swaying with her weight."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander braces their left hand against the cliff's edge and clasps Hecate's hand with their right, using it to pull upward."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"2024AB_Hecatec","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At last, they make it back up. Mityl immediately secures the safety rope to a nearby rock, ensuring there won't be another mishap."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You scared the hell out of me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry. My mistake."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm just glad you're okay."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She pulls Kuro into a big hug. Kuro squirms out of her arms."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, the Blackgold team is still here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So, what now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hecate_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hecate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's none of your concern."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hecate prepares her team for departure. The operative who tried to ambush them is silent now, head bowed and subdued."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She looks back at the three of them one last time—the Commander and Kuro remain on alert beside the box, while Mityl double-checks everyone's safety ropes. Hecate tightens the strap on her gun holster."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hecate_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Hecate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your taste in teammates has improved in the last four years."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hecate_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hecate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Next time we meet, we'll settle it for real."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hecate_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Until then."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hecate and her squad depart."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander notices the raw, bloody gash on Hecate's forearm—clearly scraped when she grabbed the rope earlier. None of her subordinates dare say a word about it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Turning back, the Commander sees Mityl tending to Kuro's injuries. Kuro swears and complains, but she still sits obediently, letting Mityl's clumsy hands work the bandages."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ow, ow, ow—careful!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I AM being careful!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Try being on the receiving end!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You okay?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's no big deal."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just a scratch on my leg. What I really want to know is—how did you know Hecate would let us go?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Because I wagered she's still the same as she was four years ago."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gather your gear. Let's talk on the move. We don't have much time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
